      "section_label": "Part I Item 1",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Products Offered",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "The growth in our prepared food and dispensed beverage program reflects the Company’s strategy to promote high-gross margin products that are compatible with convenience store operations.",
