      "subheading": "Products Offered",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Revenue less cost of goods sold (excluding depreciation and amortization) as a percentage of revenue on prepared food and dispensed beverage items averaged approximately 58% for the three fiscal years ended April 30, 2026.",
